  "details": "Description\n\nPeople using quest platform cannot see items placed by a pc user and vice versa. From experience seems to happen on the new unity-6 beta for pc users\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nOne player must be on andriod, the other has to be on the unity-6 beta on pc. Both players place items down and neither player can see what the other placed\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2-1898-626e35030c-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.60f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-27_09-42-40.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_bdc72219-8e86-43e6-b2df-00d37e95efaa/1/file)",
